<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, marginBottom: 28 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
      解决方案：一条可追溯的互助链路
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
      把「谁发的、谁接的、走到哪一步了」变成一串不可篡改的事件记录。
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 0, flex: 1 }}>
    {[
      { n: '发单', t: '发布需求', d: '选起终点、设酬劳、留取件码', c: '#2563EB' },
      { n: '抢单', t: '大厅接单', d: '接单人看到并抢下这单', c: '#2563EB' },
      { n: '履约', t: '逐步上报', d: '取件 → 配送中 → 送达', c: '#F59E0B' },
      { n: '确认', t: '确认收货', d: '发单人验收，订单完成', c: '#06B6D4' },
    ].map((s, i) => (
      <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E5E7EB', borderRadius: 12, padding: 24, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, background: s.c, borderRadius: 20, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{i + 1}</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{s.n}</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{s.d}</Text>
        </Box>
        {i < 3 ? (
          <Box style={{ width: 24, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#94A3B8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>→</Text>
          </Box>
        ) : null}
      </Box>
    ))}
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.4, flex: 1 }}>
      关键不是「有个平台」，而是每一单的每一步都留痕——<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>订单的当前状态，是把这串事件重放出来的结果，而不是一个可以被随手改掉的状态字段。</span>
    </Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
